<section class="hero">
    <p class="bac-kicker">The Arguments &middot; Bitcoin as Collateral</p>
    <h1>The pledge you can <em>see</em>.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Collateral is the pledge behind a loan &ndash; and for four thousand years, lending has turned on one question: how do you know the pledge is real?</p>
    <p class="subtitle">Bitcoin is the first asset where the pledge itself is visible: to the lender, to the borrower, to anyone, without permission. And yet today, lenders offer some of the harshest terms in secured credit against it. This exploration takes both facts seriously.</p>
</section>

